 <body>
  <table class="contentpageDefaultEmailTemplatePageTemplate" style="background-color: #E9EAEC;" role="presentation" id="contentpage_emailTemplateBodyContent" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td width="100%" align="center">
      <table class="contentRoot" style="background-color: #FFFFFF;" role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
       <tbody>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;">
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td align="Center"><img src="{[devName:SaleForceEmail_Assets7]}" alt="" width="600" style="width: 100%; display: block; border: none; max-width: 100%; object-fit: fill;" /></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
                      <div style="text-align: center;">
                       <span style="color:#8e44ad;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><em><strong><span style="font-size:10px;">¡Desplácese hacia abajo para la versión en español de este correo electrónico!<br /> 请向下滚动查看本邮件的西班牙语版本！</span></strong></em></span></span>
                      </div></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p>Hello,&nbsp;</p><p>It was lovely meeting you today! Thank you for your interest in Zeta Charter Schools and being part of the Zeta experience.&nbsp;</p><p>Applications for the 2027-2028 school year are open. Please take a few minutes to&nbsp;<a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/">apply today!</a></p><p>Once you do, your family will be invited to join upcoming events to learn more about Zeta’s next-generation education.&nbsp;</p><p>Zeta is a public charter school network that provides a tuition-free, pre-K through high school journey in the Bronx, Manhattan, and Queens. Our whole-child approach combines rigorous academics, expert-led Specialty classes, and a joyful community where students are known and loved. At Zeta, students discover their strengths and passions as they prepare for college and beyond.</p><p>You can submit an application for the 2027-28 school year using either option below:</p>
                      <ul>
                       <li aria-level="1">Apply online: Complete the<a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/"> application on our website.</a></li>
                      </ul><p>or</p>
                      <ul>
                       <li aria-level="1">Reply to this email with the following information: 
                        <ul>
                         <li aria-level="2">Student’s full first and last name</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Student’s date of birth (month/day/year)</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Student’s grade for 2027–2028</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Student’s full home address</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Phone number</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Preferred Zeta school(s)</li>
                        </ul></li>
                      </ul><p>If you have any questions as you<a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/"> complete your application</a>, please reach out at enroll@zetaschools.org or call us at (646) 480-1654.&nbsp;</p> Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team&nbsp;</strong><br /> Zeta Charter Schools<br /> ___________________________<br /> &nbsp;</td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:2px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hola,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-right:28px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-style: normal;"><span style="text-decoration: none;"><font face="Lato, sans-serif">Fue un placer conocerle en Zeta! </font></span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Gracias por su interés en Zeta Charter School y por ser parte de la experiencia Zeta. </span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="color:#333333;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;margin:0;"><span style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Las solicitudes para el año escolar 2027-2028 ya están abiertas. </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Por favor, tómese unos minutos para</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/" style="font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1154cc"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">postularse</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/" style="font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#1154cc"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">hoy</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 11pt; font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">!</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:75px; margin-top:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Una vez que lo haga, su familia será invitada a unirse a los próximos eventos para obtener más información sobre la educación de próxima generación de Zeta.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:18px; margin-top:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Zeta es una red de escuelas públicas chárter que ofrece un recorrido educativo gratuito desde el prekínder hasta la escuela secundaria en el Bronx, Manhattan y Queens. Nuestro enfoque integral combina un riguroso nivel académico, clases especializadas dirigidas por expertos y una comunidad alegre donde los estudiantes son conocidos y queridos. En Zeta, los estudiantes descubren sus fortalezas y pasiones mientras se preparan para la universidad y más allá.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:18px; margin-top:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Puede enviar una solicitud para el año escolar 2027-2028 utilizando cualquiera de las siguientes opciones:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
                      <ul>
                       <li style="line-height: 1.365; margin-right: 18px; margin-top: 16px;">Postúlese en línea: complete <a href="https://https://myportal.zetaschools.org/">la solicitud en nuestro sitio web.</a> .</li>
                      </ul><p style="line-height: 1.365; margin-right: 18px; margin-top: 16px;">O</p>
                      <ul>
                       <li aria-level="1">Responda a este correo electrónico con la siguiente información: 
                        <ul>
                         <li aria-level="2">Nombre y apellido completos del estudiante</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Fecha de nacimiento del estudiante (mes/día/año)</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Grado del estudiante para el ciclo 2027-2028</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Dirección completa del domicilio del estudiante</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Número de teléfono</li>
                         <li aria-level="2">Escuela(s) Zeta de preferencia</li>
                        </ul></li>
                      </ul> &nbsp; <p>Si tiene alguna pregunta mientras <a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/">&nbsp;completa su solicitud</a>, comuníquese con nosotros a <a href="mailto:enroll@zetaschools.org">enroll@zetaschools.org</a> o llámenos al (646) 480-1654.&nbsp;</p> &nbsp; <p>¡Esperamos llegar a conocer a su familia!&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:18px; margin-top:16px"><br /> Atentamente,<br /><strong>El equipo de admisiones de Zeta</strong><br /> Zeta Charter Schools</p><p style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:16px"><span style="color: rgb(221, 221, 221);">___________________________</span></p></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">您好，<br /><br /> 感谢您的家庭考虑 Zeta 特许学校！<br /><br /> Zeta 是一个公立特许学校教育网络，在布朗克斯、曼哈顿和皇后区提供从学前班到高中的免费教育。我们秉持全人教育理念，将扎实的学术课程、由专业教师授课的特色课程，以及充满欢乐与关爱的校园氛围融为一体，让每位学生都被了解、被关爱。在 Zeta，学生能够发现自己的优势与热爱，为升入大学及未来的发展做好准备。<br /><br /> 我们很高兴地和您分享，2027-2028学年的申请现已开放。<br /><br /><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/s/login/SelfRegister?locale=us">立即申请您所在社区的 Zeta 学校</a>。<br /><br /> 要详细了解我们的教育方法以及您心仪的学校，<a href="https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/">请注册参加即将举行的活动</a> 。<br /><br /> 同时，如果您有任何疑问，请通过 enroll@zetaschools.org 与我们联系，或致电 (646) 480-1654。<br /><br /> 谨此问候，<br /><strong>Zeta 招生团队</strong><br /> Zeta 特许学校</span></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
